              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "certō, certāre — \"to compete, to contend\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Duo aurīgae dē palmā certābant. Two charioteers were competing for the palm."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "certō, certāre, certāvī, certātum. Do not confuse the adverb certō, 'for certain'."
            }
          ]
        },
